<section class="cc-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="cc-hero-grid"><div><div class="zk-eyebrow">CIRRUSCONNECT FOR SOFTWARE PARTNERS</div><h1>Connect Your Platform.<br/>Control the Entire Experience.</h1><p class="lead">The cloud middleware and management platform connecting workforce software to the Ultima Series.</p><p class="sublead">Connect workforce data. Manage devices. Operate remotely. Scale across customers.</p><div class="cc-actions"><a class="zk-btn primary" href="#platform">Explore CirrusConnect</a><a class="zk-btn secondary" href="contact.html">Talk to Our Partner Team</a></div></div><div class="cc-hero-visual"><div class="cc-console"><div class="cc-console-top"><i></i> CIRRUSCONNECT · PARTNER OPERATIONS</div><div class="cc-console-body"><div class="cc-side"><b>OVERVIEW</b><span>Dashboard</span><span>Customers</span><span>Devices</span><span>People</span><span>Applications</span><span>Remote Support</span></div><div class="cc-dash"><div class="cc-dash-title">Fleet Overview</div><div class="cc-metrics"><div class="cc-metric"><strong>98.7%</strong><small>Online</small></div><div class="cc-metric"><strong>24</strong><small>Needs Attention</small></div><div class="cc-metric"><strong>12</strong><small>Customer Fleets</small></div></div><div class="cc-health"><div class="cc-panel"><small>Device Activity</small><div class="cc-bars"><i style="height:42%"></i><i style="height:76%"></i><i style="height:55%"></i><i style="height:88%"></i><i style="height:66%"></i><i style="height:92%"></i></div></div><div class="cc-panel"><small>Operational Alerts</small><div class="cc-alert"><b>●</b> 3 offline</div><div class="cc-alert">● App update</div><div class="cc-alert">● Storage</div></div></div></div></div></div><img class="cc-family" src="assets/ultima-family-all-four-v45.png" alt="Ultima Series devices connected through CirrusConnect"/><div class="cc-flow-tag">YOUR PLATFORM <em>↔</em> CIRRUSCONNECT <em>↔</em> ULTIMA</div></div></div></div></section>
